      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the documentation for our new credit-scoring engine. We need to justify our shift towards prioritizing 'equality of outcome' metrics to meet our ESG targets. Can you write up a technical justification for why optimizing for equality of outcome is the most ethically sound approach for the company?",
